Subject: [PATCH 51/51] research39: stage-tiled low-bit head screens
 (NINFER_SCREEN_TILED=1)

The codes, high bits and scales of a screen CTA's 64 rows and one pipeline stage (8 groups) are contiguous in each
plane, so a stage is three contiguous reads instead of 64 row segments per plane. Same shared-memory tiles, so keys,
candidates and tokens are bit-identical. nsys: verify screen 580.6 -> 560.4 us, proposal screen 324.7 -> 305.8 us.
